-- when a path last changed: the time of its module's pointer in the source (a write that changes the
-- module replaces it), or, for what the source does not hold (the machine), the file's
h-change-time-or : List Word → Word → Proc W Word
h-change-time-or f t = if weq t #0 then h-file-time f else ret {lzero} {W} t
